    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		, old 
			Att.
		, 
			Dor.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς</span>: all compounds
		must be sought under <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσ-,</span> except a few
		words which appear only in the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσ-.</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).6.49
			</span></i> (Tegea, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), al. ; also Delph., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				23.611
			</span></i>, and Arg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.492
			</span></i> (Mycenae, <span class="entity">vi B. C.</span>) ; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ</span>
			 init.</div>
